the controlled drug was supplied a signed requisition in accordance with the undertaking.

(4) The persons referred to in paragraph (2) are—
(a) a practitioner;
(b) the person in charge or acting person in charge of [F170a hospital, organisation providing
ambulance services] or [F171care home];
(c) a person who is in charge of a laboratory;
(d) the owner of a ship, or the master of a ship which does not carry a doctor among the
seamen employed in it;
(e) the master of a foreign ship in a port in Great Britain;
(f) the installation manager of an offshore installation.
[F172(g) a supplementary prescriber];
[F173(h) a nurse independent prescriber;
(i) a pharmacist independent prescriber]
[F174(j) a person who holds a certificate of proficiency in ambulance paramedic skills issued by,
or with the approval of, the Secretary of State, or a person who is a registered paramedic]
